{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only model with singleprofile setting using scvi_n200 encoder, achieving validation accuracy of 0.520 and F1 of 0.498, outperforming the singleprofile PCA_n2000 baseline (0.485 accuracy, 0.464 F1). The result suggests scvi_n200 may contribute to performance gains in singleprofile setups, but uncertainty remains about whether multiprofile benefits observed in prior experiments stem from profile structure or encoder capabilities, as no direct comparison to alternative encoders or fusion strategies was conducted."
}

